{"name": "Atrum", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Atrum, you play as a powerful mage descending into a world consumed by darkness. This dark fantasy, third-person roguelike challenges you to survive fast-paced combat against relentless enemies and bosses across corrupted realms. With each run, powerful magical items and abilities reshape your build, forcing you to adapt as you push deeper into the darkness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Master Spell-Based Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn enemy patterns, dodge incoming threats, and unleash powerful spells in fast-paced, skill-driven combat. Every encounter tests your positioning, timing, and mastery of magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740210/extras/cf673244263ea44630a3b98a27226492.poster.avif?t=1775913990\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740210/extras/cf673244263ea44630a3b98a27226492.webm?t=1775913990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740210/extras/cf673244263ea44630a3b98a27226492.mp4?t=1775913990\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Collect Powerful Items and Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover magical items and abilities that change how you play each run. Experiment with new combinations, adapt on the fly, and shape your build through powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740210/extras/d3506d4679fbf2e3ac255b59bb35c572.poster.avif?t=1775913990\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740210/extras/d3506d4679fbf2e3ac255b59bb35c572.webm?t=1775913990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740210/extras/d3506d4679fbf2e3ac255b59bb35c572.mp4?t=1775913990\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Uncover the Secrets of Atrum</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Descend deeper into Atrum to uncover hidden secrets, unlock new possibilities, and confront the darkness that lurks below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740210/extras/604c1895c8efe3d3aac238746b56a538.poster.avif?t=1775913990\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740210/extras/604c1895c8efe3d3aac238746b56a538.webm?t=1775913990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740210/extras/604c1895c8efe3d3aac238746b56a538.mp4?t=1775913990\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Atrum is a dark fantasy, third-person roguelike where you play as a powerful mage descending into darkness. Fight challenging enemies and bosses across corrupted realms and collect magical items to shape your build before the darkness consumes you.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740210/e7ee7339716c8342ab8f5738a1eb86dcfe767708/header.jpg?t=1775913990", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Third Person", "Dungeon Crawler", "Roguelite", "Magic", "RPG"], "developers": "Duskwake Games", "publishers": "Duskwake Games", "release_date": "2026", "price